<section image-layout="blank" id="ANgowHxrXr" background-color="heading"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="pDBvjEM_n1" vertical-align="center" colspan="38"><p role="eyebrow">Nguyễn Du · The Tale of Kiều</p><h1 font-size="44pt">A poem carried by its rhythm</h1><p font-size="19pt"><b><i>Truyện Kiều</i> turns a life under pressure into a test of how we judge choice.</b></p><spacer size="16pt"></spacer><grid spacing="none" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="xBahEwe6u4" background-color="surface" padding="14pt 16pt"><p role="eyebrow">Opening sound</p><h3 font-size="19pt">Trăm năm trong cõi người <span text-color="accent">ta</span><br>Chữ tài chữ mệnh khéo <span text-color="accent">là</span> ghét nhau</h3><p font-size="14pt"><b>Six syllables → eight syllables</b> · <span text-color="accent">ta–là</span> rhyme bridge</p></grid-item></grid><p font-size="14pt">Original Vietnamese evidence; no claim that an English paraphrase preserves the meter.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="6Go0Byn5TO" padding="0" colspan="22"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/QtwXbwgOWg-DMCIf.png" saved-media-id="dnednlm4384rxpz" source="image.ai-generated" fill="true" image-style="vietnamese-manuscript-editorial" alt="Ink-and-opaque-pigment editorial illustration on warm dó-paper-like fibers, an open manuscript folio without legible writing beside a river threshold and a narrow vermilion cord passing forward through the composition, Vietnamese chữ Nôm woodblock sensibility, lampblack, old gold and indigo under soft window light, no text or lettering" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:864,&quot;height&quot;:1152}"></grid-item></grid><shape preset="line" x="56" y="486" w="848" h="2" stroke="accent" stroke-width="3"></shape></section>
<section image-layout="blank" id="krb3Ri3Dmw"><grid spacing="medium"><grid-item id="hVLhsO1uHX" padding="0" colspan="22"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/ZQkGuWYHm8sK9YeTw_iyp.png" saved-media-id="z2jecmo6ylvf0tx" source="image.ai-generated" fill="true" image-style="vietnamese-manuscript-editorial" alt="Ink-and-opaque-pigment editorial illustration on warm dó-paper-like fibers, an imagined non-documentary literary portrait of Nguyễn Du seated near an unlettered manuscript folio, reserved expression, Vietnamese woodblock-inspired contours, lampblack robes with muted old gold and indigo details, soft window light, no text or lettering" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1248,&quot;height&quot;:1664}"></grid-item><grid-item id="sFwcG1CEzO" vertical-align="center" colspan="38"><h2>Nguyễn Du and the work</h2><p font-size="18pt"><b>Nguyễn Du (1765–1820)</b> created a defining work of Vietnamese literature. <i>Truyện Kiều</i>, or <i>The Tale of Kiều</i>, comprises 3,254 lines written in chữ Nôm and composed in lục bát verse.</p><p font-size="18pt">Its achievement is both narrative and formal: a long story sustained through voice, rhyme, cadence, and ethical tension.</p><grid divider="sm neutral-border" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="wXp0AzLctl" vertical-align="center" colspan="20"><display size="md" font-size="30pt">1765–1820</display><h4>Nguyễn Du</h4></grid-item><grid-item id="6i0inIUrMS" vertical-align="center" colspan="20"><display size="md" font-size="40pt">3,254</display><h4>Lines</h4></grid-item><grid-item id="Y28tQENZtC" vertical-align="center" colspan="20"><display size="md" font-size="32pt">lục bát</display><h4>Form</h4><p font-size="14pt">Composed in chữ Nôm.</p></grid-item></grid><p font-size="12pt"><b>Interpretive portrait; not documentary evidence.</b> Sources: <a href="https://baotangvanhoc.vn/hien-vat-hinh-anh/hien-vat-len-tieng/truyen-kieu-mot-kiet-tac-van-hoc/">“Truyện Kiều—một kiệt tác văn học,” Vietnamese Literature Museum</a>; <a href="https://www.nomfoundation.org/nom-project/Tale-of-Kieu?uiLang=vn"><i>Tale of Kiều</i> project, Vietnamese Nôm Preservation Foundation</a>.</p></grid-item></grid></section>
<section image-layout="blank" id="sK9WZy6RzN"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="JI3xSAeLQU" vertical-align="center" colspan="44"><h2>A life redirected by obligation</h2><p font-size="18pt">The plot advances through choices made under increasing pressure—not through passive misfortune alone.</p><table col-widths="[16,22,22]" header-row="true" borders="rows" striped="false"><tbody><tr><td background-color="accent"><p>Stage</p></td><td background-color="accent"><p>Choice under pressure</p></td><td background-color="accent"><p>Consequence carried forward</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><b>Vow</b></p></td><td background-color="surface"><p>Kiều commits to Kim Trọng.</p></td><td><p>A shared future is imagined.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><b>Family crisis</b></p></td><td background-color="surface"><p>She sells herself to rescue her family.</p></td><td><p>Filial duty redirects her life.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><b>Exploitation</b></p></td><td background-color="surface"><p>She resists sale, coercion, and persecution.</p></td><td><p>Private vows meet a predatory market.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><b>Brief reversal</b></p></td><td background-color="surface"><p>She acts beside Từ Hải.</p></td><td><p>Power opens, then closes through deception.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><b>Return</b></p></td><td background-color="surface"><p>Giác Duyên’s rescue enables reunion.</p></td><td><p>Survival continues; harm is not erased.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p font-size="12pt">Condensed plot route; role labels are prioritized over a larger cast list.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="CtAdrnITem" padding="0" colspan="16"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/kMCAEh8py1gTY-civJCL-.png" saved-media-id="17vwjme5si9118s" source="image.ai-generated" fill="true" image-style="vietnamese-manuscript-editorial" alt="Ink-and-opaque-pigment editorial illustration on warm dó-paper-like fibers, a non-documentary literary figure crossing successive Vietnamese gates toward a distant river, the path narrowing through shadow and opening again at dawn, lampblack, vermilion, old gold and indigo, manuscript and woodblock conventions, no text or lettering" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1248,&quot;height&quot;:1664}"></grid-item></grid></section>
<section image-layout="blank" id="ILAB69lNX1"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="2AzXksURyT" padding="0" colspan="24"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/sMcA5Bjv27wPqxxdMMRLv.png" saved-media-id="dr3hk9auh08yv0i" source="image.ai-generated" fill="true" image-style="vietnamese-manuscript-editorial" alt="Ink-and-opaque-pigment editorial illustration on warm dó-paper-like fibers, a non-documentary literary figure representing Thúy Kiều seated beside a stringed instrument at the left of the frame, alert and self-possessed while architectural screens narrow behind her, quiet open field on the right, Vietnamese manuscript and woodblock sensibility, lampblack, vermilion, old gold and indigo, no text or lettering" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1920,&quot;height&quot;:1088}"></grid-item><grid-item id="sFwcG1CEzO" vertical-align="center" colspan="36"><p role="eyebrow">Character study</p><h2>Thúy Kiều: gifted, ethical, constrained</h2><p font-size="18pt">Artistically gifted and emotionally perceptive, Kiều acts decisively inside social and material limits that keep narrowing.</p><grid spacing="none" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="-rNdB-Ohan" background-color="accent" padding="12pt 16pt"><h3 font-size="19pt">Her agency is real—but never exercised on equal terms.</h3></grid-item></grid><p role="eyebrow">Choice field narrows →</p><grid spacing="none" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="wpt3a9PVDy" background-color="surface" cell-decor="side-line" padding="10pt 14pt" colspan="60"><h4>Love</h4><p font-size="18pt">A future she actively values.</p></grid-item></grid><grid spacing="none" vertical-sizing="hug"><spacer span="4"></spacer><grid-item id="-Ra39MxZzs" background-color="surface" cell-decor="side-line" padding="10pt 14pt" colspan="56"><h4>Filial duty</h4><p font-size="18pt">She exchanges that future for family safety.</p></grid-item></grid><grid spacing="none" vertical-sizing="hug"><spacer span="8"></spacer><grid-item id="XHQkv2CPeB" background-color="surface" cell-decor="side-line" padding="10pt 14pt" colspan="52"><h4>Survival</h4><p font-size="18pt">Compromise, trust, resistance, or flight.</p></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid><box type="content" x="24" y="492" w="300" h="30" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 5pt 8pt; border-radius: 3pt;"><p font-size="12pt"><b>Interpretive illustration—not documentary evidence.</b></p></box></section>
<section image-layout="blank" id="PcsKKeIAM7"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="VMGbYYLq_P"><labels><label variant="solid">Interpretive claim</label></labels><h2>Realism: a social world closes in</h2><p font-size="18pt">The poem exposes a recurring system: different actors appear, but money, procedure, and gendered judgment keep narrowing Kiều’s available choices.</p><freeform-block w="840" h="270"><box type="content" x="40" y="76" w="760" h="126" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="border-radius: 4pt;"><p></p></box><shape preset="line" x="40" y="78" w="760" h="2" rotation="3" stroke="accent" stroke-width="3"></shape><shape preset="line" x="40" y="200" w="760" h="2" rotation="-3" stroke="accent" stroke-width="3"></shape><shape preset="line" x="40" y="138" w="760" h="2" stroke="accent" stroke-width="3"></shape><box type="content" x="176" y="64" w="2" h="70" sizing="fixed" background-color="accent"><p></p></box><box type="content" x="342" y="140" w="2" h="62" sizing="fixed" background-color="accent"><p></p></box><box type="content" x="556" y="64" w="2" h="70" sizing="fixed" background-color="accent"><p></p></box><box type="content" x="718" y="140" w="2" h="62" sizing="fixed" background-color="accent"><p></p></box><box type="content" x="169" y="131" w="16" h="16" sizing="fixed" background-color="accent" style="border-radius: 999pt;"><p></p></box><box type="content" x="335" y="131" w="16" h="16" sizing="fixed" background-color="accent" style="border-radius: 999pt;"><p></p></box><box type="content" x="549" y="131" w="16" h="16" sizing="fixed" background-color="accent" style="border-radius: 999pt;"><p></p></box><box type="content" x="711" y="131" w="16" h="16" sizing="fixed" background-color="accent" style="border-radius: 999pt;"><p></p></box><box type="content" x="82" y="8" w="190" h="58" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 8pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid var(--neutral-border-color);"><h4>Money</h4><p font-size="15pt">Family crisis becomes a market for Kiều’s body.</p></box><box type="content" x="252" y="202" w="202" h="60" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 8pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid var(--neutral-border-color);"><h4>Official procedure</h4><p font-size="15pt">Coercion and betrayal acquire lawful language.</p></box><box type="content" x="448" y="8" w="216" h="58" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 8pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid var(--neutral-border-color);"><h4>Gendered judgment</h4><p font-size="15pt">Female reputation is policed more harshly.</p></box><box type="content" x="630" y="202" w="180" h="60" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 8pt 10pt; border: 1pt solid var(--neutral-border-color);"><h4>Repeated reversals</h4><p font-size="15pt">New actors reproduce the pressure.</p></box><box type="content" x="304" y="111" w="236" h="54" vertical-align="center" sizing="fixed" background-color="accent" style="padding: 7pt 12pt; border-radius: 3pt;"><h4 align="center">Kiều’s available choices</h4></box></freeform-block><p font-size="18pt"><b>Different actors; the same narrowing social logic.</b></p></grid-item></grid></section>
<section image-layout="blank" id="aRGt5c88w5"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="ZhJiyO8TJT" background-color="palette-3" vertical-align="center" colspan="20"><p role="eyebrow">Humanitarian reading</p><h2>Dignity under pressure</h2><p font-size="18pt"><b>Constrained choice is not the same as moral failure.</b></p><p font-size="18pt">The poem asks not only what happens to Kiều, but what kind of world makes her sacrifices necessary.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="wgllm9yZwR" vertical-align="center" colspan="40"><h3>Episode → action → interpretation</h3><table col-widths="[18,22,20]" header-row="true" borders="rows" striped="false"><tbody><tr><td><p>Episode</p></td><td><p>What Kiều does</p></td><td background-color="surface"><p>Humanitarian insight</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><b>Family crisis</b></p></td><td><p>Sells herself to protect her family.</p></td><td background-color="surface"><p>The sacrifice is admirable; the demand is unjust.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><b>Mã Giám Sinh and Tú Bà</b></p></td><td><p>Tries to survive sale and coercion.</p></td><td background-color="surface"><p>Constraint must not be confused with moral failure.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><b>Từ Hải</b></p></td><td><p>Acts within a brief reversal of power.</p></td><td background-color="surface"><p>Talent and judgment emerge when shelter exists.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><b>Giác Duyên and reunion</b></p></td><td><p>Survives and renegotiates return.</p></td><td background-color="surface"><p>Rescue matters; accumulated harm is not cancelled.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p font-size="12pt">Episode reference: <a href="https://www.nomfoundation.org/nom-project/Tale-of-Kieu?uiLang=vn"><i>Tale of Kiều</i>, Vietnamese Nôm Preservation Foundation</a>. Interpretations are identified as readings, not direct quotations.</p></grid-item></grid></section>
<section image-layout="blank" id="qNxHLiQlEL"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="nbktSbpC8C"><h2>How lục bát moves</h2><freeform-block w="840" h="248"><box type="content" y="20" w="128"><p role="eyebrow">Six syllables</p></box><box type="content" y="124" w="128"><p role="eyebrow">Eight syllables</p></box><box type="content" x="145" y="8" w="82" h="62" vertical-align="center" horizontal-align="center" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 4pt; border-radius: 3pt;"><p font-size="11pt">1</p><h4>Trăm</h4></box><box type="content" x="245" y="8" w="82" h="62" vertical-align="center" horizontal-align="center" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 4pt; border-radius: 3pt;"><p font-size="11pt"><b>2 · B</b></p><h4>năm</h4></box><box type="content" x="345" y="8" w="82" h="62" vertical-align="center" horizontal-align="center" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 4pt; border-radius: 3pt;"><p font-size="11pt">3</p><h4>trong</h4></box><box type="content" x="445" y="8" w="82" h="62" vertical-align="center" horizontal-align="center" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 4pt; border-radius: 3pt;"><p font-size="11pt"><b>4 · T</b></p><h4>cõi</h4></box><box type="content" x="545" y="8" w="82" h="62" vertical-align="center" horizontal-align="center" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 4pt; border-radius: 3pt;"><p font-size="11pt">5</p><h4>người</h4></box><box type="content" x="645" y="8" w="82" h="62" vertical-align="center" horizontal-align="center" sizing="fixed" background-color="accent" style="padding: 4pt; border-radius: 3pt;"><p font-size="11pt"><b>6 · B</b></p><h4>ta</h4></box><box type="content" x="145" y="112" w="78" h="62" vertical-align="center" horizontal-align="center" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 4pt; border-radius: 3pt;"><p font-size="11pt">1</p><h4>Chữ</h4></box><box type="content" x="230" y="112" w="78" h="62" vertical-align="center" horizontal-align="center" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 4pt; border-radius: 3pt;"><p font-size="11pt"><b>2 · B</b></p><h4>tài</h4></box><box type="content" x="315" y="112" w="78" h="62" vertical-align="center" horizontal-align="center" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 4pt; border-radius: 3pt;"><p font-size="11pt">3</p><h4>chữ</h4></box><box type="content" x="400" y="112" w="78" h="62" vertical-align="center" horizontal-align="center" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 4pt; border-radius: 3pt;"><p font-size="11pt"><b>4 · T</b></p><h4>mệnh</h4></box><box type="content" x="485" y="112" w="78" h="62" vertical-align="center" horizontal-align="center" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 4pt; border-radius: 3pt;"><p font-size="11pt">5</p><h4>khéo</h4></box><box type="content" x="570" y="112" w="78" h="62" vertical-align="center" horizontal-align="center" sizing="fixed" background-color="accent" style="padding: 4pt; border-radius: 3pt;"><p font-size="11pt"><b>6 · B</b></p><h4>là</h4></box><box type="content" x="655" y="112" w="78" h="62" vertical-align="center" horizontal-align="center" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 4pt; border-radius: 3pt;"><p font-size="11pt">7</p><h4>ghét</h4></box><box type="content" x="740" y="112" w="78" h="62" vertical-align="center" horizontal-align="center" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 4pt; border-radius: 3pt;"><p font-size="11pt"><b>8 · B</b></p><h4>nhau</h4></box><shape preset="line" x="607" y="88" w="87" h="2" rotation="-28" stroke="accent" stroke-width="3"></shape><box type="content" x="700" y="78" w="128"><p font-size="12pt"><b>ta–là rhyme</b></p></box><shape preset="line" x="704" y="188" w="98" h="2" rotation="-18" stroke="accent" stroke-width="3"></shape><box type="content" x="548" y="182" w="150"><p font-size="12pt"><b>end rhyme carries forward</b></p></box><box type="content" x="604" y="204" w="214" h="38" vertical-align="center" sizing="fixed" style="padding: 5pt 9pt; border: 1pt solid var(--accent-color); border-radius: 3pt;"><p font-size="14pt" align="center"><b>next six-line · syllable 6</b></p></box></freeform-block><grid spacing="medium" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="6X6snwE59F" colspan="30"><h4>Tone-class check</h4><p font-size="16pt">At the marked positions, this couplet reads <b>B–T–B</b> / <b>B–T–B–B</b>. B = bằng; T = trắc.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="aFT74gqgxP" colspan="30"><h4>Rhyme chain</h4><p font-size="16pt"><b>ta</b> rhymes with <b>là</b> at syllable 6; <b>nhau</b> can carry to syllable 6 of the next six-line.</p></grid-item></grid><p font-size="12pt">Original text: <a href="https://www.nomfoundation.org/nom-project/Tale-of-Kieu?uiLang=vn">Vietnamese Nôm Preservation Foundation</a>. English paraphrase cannot demonstrate the original meter.</p></grid-item></grid></section>
<section image-layout="blank" id="DRRlAou9Jr" background-color="heading"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="YhA-KQEVze" vertical-align="center" colspan="38"><p role="eyebrow">Closing interpretation</p><h1 font-size="38pt">What the poem carries forward</h1><p font-size="18pt">Form and meaning meet in a shared logic of continuation.</p><grid marker="symbol" marker-size="small" marker-label="→" marker-style="solid" marker-shape="circle" marker-position="inline" direction="vertical" spacing="none" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="LpJjRdjosR" padding="10pt 0"><p font-size="18pt"><b>Sound.</b> Rhyme carries one line into the next.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="LFLo_cl7B_" padding="10pt 0"><p font-size="18pt"><b>Consequence.</b> Choices carry effects beyond the moment of choosing.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="Hrh3mBA_VJ" padding="10pt 0"><p font-size="18pt"><b>Judgment.</b> Survival carries dignity beyond injury—not beyond memory.</p></grid-item></grid><hr color="accent" thickness="md" width="xs"><h3 role="subheading">Read the reunion as continuation, not reset.</h3></grid-item><grid-item id="ozaN15RCxl" padding="0" colspan="22"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/Xw3OzZq3eNb1c4oO4GJcZ.png" saved-media-id="zqbqzwskt4eoc45" source="image.ai-generated" fill="true" image-style="vietnamese-manuscript-editorial" alt="Ink-and-opaque-pigment editorial illustration on warm dó-paper-like fibers, a small boat at dawn crossing from a shadowed river gate into open water, its wake continuing beyond the right edge of the frame, Vietnamese manuscript and woodblock sensibility, lampblack, muted old gold and indigo with restrained vermilion accents, no text or lettering" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1248,&quot;height&quot;:1664}"></grid-item></grid><shape preset="line" x="56" y="486" w="904" h="2" stroke="accent" stroke-width="3"></shape></section>